# Brewfile: the packages `brew bundle` installs on this machine.
#
# This is a template. run_after_10-packages renders it, appends the cask and
# App Store lines that belong on this machine from .chezmoidata/apps.yaml, and
# runs `brew bundle` on the result, which it leaves in the state directory.
# Edit this file, not the generated copy, then `chezmoi apply`.
#
# Formulae and fonts install on every Mac, a managed one included. Desktop
# casks and App Store apps are data, not template lines, because the script
# has to skip the ones that are already in /Applications without Homebrew.
#
# The list is the classification in
# docs/PRDs/2026-09-10-chezmoi-mac-bootstrap/research-notes.md section 9.

